# Default build: temporary GitHub Pages address (project site).
# SITE_BASE must match the repository name exactly, including letter case. On 2026-11-17 GitHub reported the
# canonical name as "Korikashi/Luna-Workstation-Releases" (lowercase "s" in "Workstation"), so the Pages address
# GitHub generates is expected to use that spelling. Check Settings → Pages after the first deployment and adjust
# both values if GitHub shows a different address (see docs/PUBLISHING.md).
SITE_BASE=/Luna-Workstation-Releases/
SITE_URL=https://korikashi.github.io/Luna-Workstation-Releases/
